PUBLIC NOTICE NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that the public hearing for the following ordinance which was to be presented for a public hearing and first reading before the City Council of the City of Panama City Beach, Florida at9 A.M on THURSDAY, OCTOBER 22, 2026, or as soon thereafter as the matter would be heard, at City Hall located at 17007 Panama City Beach Parkway, Panama City , has been CANCELLED, to-wit: ORDINANCE NO. 1691 AN ORDINANCE OF THE CITY OF PANAMA CITY BEACH, FLORIDA, ADOPTING A SIX-MONTH MORATORIUM ON THE APPROVAL OF TRADITIONAL NEIGHBORHOOD OVERLAY DISTRICTS AND RELATED DEVELOPMENT APPROVALS;
REPEALING ALL ORDINANCES IN CONFLICT;
PROVIDING FOR SEVERABILITY;
SCRIVENER’S ERRORS;
LIBERAL INTERPRETATION;
MODIFICATIONS;
CODIFICATION;
AND PROVIDING FOR AN EFFECTIVE DATE.

