NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that the following entitled ordinance shall be presented to the Lynn Haven City Commission for final adoption at its regular meeting to be conducted at 5.30 p.m. on TUESDAY October 27 th , 2026, to wit: ORDINANCE No. 1192R AN ORDINANCE OF THE CITY COMMISSION OF LYNN HAVEN, FLORIDA, AMENDING CHAPTER 42 OF THE CITY’S CODE OF ORDINANCES RELATED TO PARKS AND RECREATION, TO GENERALLY UPDATE THE RULES OF CONDUCT;
ESTABLISHING RULES AND REGULATIONS REGARDING PETS IN PARKS;
PROVIDING FOR PARK USER’S ASSUMPTION OF RISK AND LIMITATION OF CITY LIABILITY;
PROHIBITING PERSONS FROM REMAINING IN A CITY PARK BETWEEN 11:59 P.M. AND 5:00 A.M. EXCEPT AS EXPRESSLY POSTED OR PERMITTED;
ESTABLISHING VOLUME LEVELS FOR AUDIO DEVICES IN CORRESPONDENCE WITH THE NOISE ORDINANCE;
CORRECTING SCRIVENER’S ERRORS;
REVISING CORRESPONDING CODES FOR CONSISTENCY AND AGREEMENT;
REPEALING ORDINANCES IN CONFLICT;
PROVIDING FOR OTHER USES AS PROVIDING FOR SEVERABILITY;
PROVIDING FOR CODIFICATION;
AND PROVIDING AN EFFECTIVE DATE.
